ail compilation instead of silently losing reclamation. Remove the unused Queue growth pair.\n\nIntegrate owner-approved accounting-only test handoffs without their unrelated redesigns:\n- L3 server source commit 930b4fd823a85f80d4aaa6b4a74c4d230fa2aa5e, patch SHA256 419dc8c6055e824b8442ccbd5de7b88deda4bed868a0866d0dc5506e1ed04ae8.\n- L1 provider source commit 83b4dcdd2e3c835d2db48f8624ccd2bf5a7ec7df, patch SHA256 0e33f478faeb2d696df7dbef8b6a58985c53aa332e224f4f169a02bef6a2b459.\nBoth handoffs target exact ad16a67b01e419ed0cb78773f0508bd53c54bc0a; all 34 server CustodyPool reserve calls remain unchanged.\n\nValidation: direct API 5/5, retention 37/37; both removed names compile on ad16 and fail for missing members here. All six canonical selected local batches pass through run_selected.py: logic, Debug admission, check, Codex H2, evaluator churn and transport H2. No aliases, wire or Store-format changes.\n\nAmp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-01a15022-68fc-744e-a314-50757b2ff306\nCo-authored-by: Divyansh Golyan <divyanshdgolyan@gmail.com>","timestamp":"2026-10-18T23:00:09Z","author":{"name":"Amp","email":"amp@ampcode.com"},"committer":{"name":"Amp","email":"amp@ampcode.com"}},"repository":{"id":1344912307,"node_id":"R_kgDOUCm7sw","name":"rui","full_name":"DivyanshGolyan/rui","private":false,"owner":{"login":"DivyanshGolyan","id":13207611,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjA3NjEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13207611?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DivyanshGolyan","html_url":"https://github.com/DivyanshGolyan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DivyanshGolyan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DivyanshGolyan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DivyanshGolyan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DivyanshGolyan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DivyanshGolyan/subscriptions","organizations_url":